<title>MEXICO: Mexico cattle report, feeder export price - USDA.</title>
<headline>Mexico cattle report, feeder export price - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported Monday that around 200 head were exported into the United States at one crossing point Friday.</p>
<p>Through Laredo, Texas, around 200 head were sold, although not enough cattle were traded to establish trend or market prices.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530)) E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
